  "sentences": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "Try to tickle yourself.",
      "beat_id": "b1",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 1.508
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Go on.",
      "beat_id": "b1",
      "start": 1.668,
      "end": 2.436
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Nothing, right?",
      "beat_id": "b1",
      "start": 2.596,
      "end": 3.57
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "That's because your brain is a giant spoiler machine.",
      "beat_id": "b2",
      "start": 3.81,
      "end": 6.898
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Every time you move, it predicts exactly what you're about to feel, and turns the volume down.",
      "beat_id": "b3",
      "start": 7.138,
      "end": 13.031
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "A tickle needs surprise.",
      "beat_id": "b4",
      "start": 13.271,
      "end": 14.823
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "And you can't surprise yourself.",
      "beat_id": "b4",
      "start": 14.983,
      "end": 16.723
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "But scientists found a loophole: a robot that copies your hand with a tiny delay.",
      "beat_id": "b5",
      "start": 16.963,
      "end": 22.313
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "Add just a fifth of a second, and suddenly, you're ticklish again.",
      "beat_id": "b6",
      "start": 22.553,
      "end": 26.391
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "So yes, you can tickle yourself.",
      "beat_id": "b7",
      "start": 26.631,
      "end": 28.708
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "You just need a robot.",
      "beat_id": "b7",
      "start": 28.868,
      "end": 30.319
    }
  ]
